{{Term/Store|Mountain Goat|Mountain Goats|Series, BotW, TotK|plural}} are recurring [[Creature]]s in {{TLoZ Series}}.<ref>{{Cite|'''Mountain Goat'''|Hyrule Compendium|BotW}}</ref><ref>{{Cite|'''Mountain Goat'''|Hyrule Compendium|TotK}}</ref>

==Characteristics==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Compendium/Extract|Mountain Goat}}
Mountain Goats are common [[Creature]]s that primarily inhabit open fields in hilly and mountainous areas, such as [[Hyrule Ridge]] and the [[Great Hyrule Forest]].<ref name="Compendium">{{Cite|These herbivores make their home in meadows and rocky areas. Their characteristically strong legs and hooves facilitate easy climbing over rocks. Goats aren't very quick, so they make good targets for beginning hunters.|Hyrule Compendium|BotW}}</ref> They are herbivores, and their strong hooves are able to easily climb over rocks.<ref name="Compendium"/> Despite this, Mountain Goats are not fast, making them prime targets for new hunters.<ref name="Compendium"/>

When Mountain Goats spot either [[Link]] or [[Monster]]s nearby, they will flee. If approached from the front, they may attempt to charge Link down. They only attempt to do so once, and they will flee afterwards regardless of whether they successfully damaged Link or not. When killed, Mountain Goats drop [[Raw Meat]].

